            "detailed_description": "A musical puzzle game, starring Chromie the cat! Connect Green Gems to score points; the longer the path, the more points you earn. Red Gems will block your path and can create pits, while Blue Gems will restore tiles and give you a bonus. The positions of the gems will create music as you play the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Six unlockable songs, with more to come<br />\r\n* Unlockable game modes (Tempo, Excerpt, and Performance)<br />\r\n* Unlockable accessories for Chromie<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(Like many video games, this game contains flashing lights. If you are sensitive to flashing lights, please do not play this app.)",
            "about_the_game": "A musical puzzle game, starring Chromie the cat! Connect Green Gems to score points; the longer the path, the more points you earn. Red Gems will block your path and can create pits, while Blue Gems will restore tiles and give you a bonus. The positions of the gems will create music as you play the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Six unlockable songs, with more to come<br />\r\n* Unlockable game modes (Tempo, Excerpt, and Performance)<br />\r\n* Unlockable accessories for Chromie<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(Like many video games, this game contains flashing lights. If you are sensitive to flashing lights, please do not play this app.)",
